{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning, everyone. Thank you for joining me. As you know, we're reviewing the proposed eighth-grade makerspace program before I make a final authorization decision. The draft calls for 24 students supervised by one STEM teacher, using soldering stations, hand tools, a laser cutter, standard metal components, and cloud-based CAD files, meeting twice a week during the spring semester. Following our usual practice, I'd like to hear from each of you on the implementation aspects relevant to your roles. Could we start with you, STEM teacher — what can you tell me about supervising this program?"}
